# L §5.14 / E §4.2 step 3 (tally 2.3, #247; the lead's P10, H1): a decision whose day is a hole (dd, a
# window) never runs and is never waited for: `top`'s read of its leg (its month's sweeps) is the day's hole,
# and so is the balance it books into; each pinned day gives 100.00 PLN. Before: RUN-ORDER.
=== m.tally
model b1h
  tally 2
  on 2026-04-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
source card "invented"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind sweeps: event certain
  leg cash: PLN
kind tops: event certain
  leg cash: PLN
place sav: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place sv2: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input pay: money PLN
input dd: date
input dt: date
move sweep: sweeps
  on dd
  reads sav
  leg cash from sav to world amount min(bal(sav), pay)
move top: tops
  on dt
  reads sv2, sweep
  leg cash from world to sv2 amount sum(t.cash.amount for t in sweeps over month_of(dt)) + 0 * bal(sv2)
version v_card
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  pay = 100.00 PLN "c"
  dt = 2026-05-31 "c"
  dd = window(2026-05-04, 2026-05-06) "c"
  opening[sav] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "c"
  opening[sv2] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "c"
ask f: flows(top, 2026-05)
ask f_p4: flows(top, 2026-05) with dd = 2026-05-04
ask b: bal(sv2, 2026-06-30)
ask b_p5: bal(sv2, 2026-06-30) with dd = 2026-05-05
=== expect
b: ?"date within window(2026-05-04, 2026-05-06) not precise enough for the day of sweep" (dd)
  unknown day: dd
  cut 2026-04-20
b_p5: 100.00 PLN
  pinned: dd = 2026-05-05
  cut 2026-04-20
f: ?"date within window(2026-05-04, 2026-05-06) not precise enough for the day of sweep" (dd)
  unknown day: dd
  cut 2026-04-20
f_p4: 100.00 PLN
  pinned: dd = 2026-05-04
  cut 2026-04-20
